@prefix connoss: <https://purls.helmholtz-metadaten.de/connoss/> .
@prefix fair4ml: <https://w3id.org/fair4ml#> .
@prefix maSMP: <https://discovery.biothings.io/view/maSMP/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
